#: a85a76cd1cba42bca31ab489cdd621cd
msgid "Wiring your Motors for X or + mode configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:151
#: 3f56b68cdf50471d8119171e4414d2f7
msgid "Using a Standard RC Radio Receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:154
#: e2813292da7e49089543064c33e340f8
msgid ""
"**You can use a standard radio receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder in "
"place of the PPM-SUM receiver.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:157
#: a581077410e94096b1f6e499d984adba
msgid ""
"An 8 Channel PPM Encoder is available from `jDrones here "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/pixhawk_px4_paparazzi_ppm_encoder_v2_p/eleppmenc20.htm>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:159
#: dfd8cb15fbb64b76a656689df71cd434
msgid ""
"Solder a 3x8 Right angle connector from the top into one end of the 8 "
"Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:161
#: 18647c58e64644a98b8ca10bb960cc63
msgid ""
"With the 3x8 connector up and facing away from you, solder a 3x1 Right "
"angle connector on the right edge of the 8 Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:165
#: 910330e88dfe4bb09464f51cd0023b94
msgid ""
"**Connect 5-8 output channels of your receiver to the inputs of the 8 "
"Channel Encoder (signal wire furthest from board) with 5-8 female to "
"female servo jumpers.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:169
#: 9a49c4dccb9f4e84a9f1a4025dd56f07
msgid ""
"Connect the PPM-SUM signal output of the Encoder to the PX4FMU boards PPM"
" sum signal input (Pin 6 of the 15 pin Multi connector)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:171
#: 44cb3180ca794064a9f84b23059aba28
msgid ""
"Connect the PPM-SUM ground input of the Encoder to the PX4FMU boards "
"ground connection (Pin 1 of the 15 pin Multi connector)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:173
#: b920f3f6b59549de86b415382edd5546
msgid ""
"Connect the PPM-SUM power input of the Encoder to the PX4FMU boards power"
" connection (Pin 15 of the 15 pin Multi connector)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:178
#: dbca097e97f845a9a092b26ccf7ed948
msgid "3DRobotics 8 Channel PPM-Sum Encoder"
msgstr ""

